  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/289190b8eddff9db4de71726deefe39f2fa3f572_0.webp\" alt=\"更優質裝備\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmlc-better-gear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/950383d82f32a34a40ec7649ac80f4464aa69234.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mlc-better-gear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ba2be45369fc28b82a33ed20f21f98dfeb53dfb1.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>ㅤ <a href=\"https://discord.gg/R4xP5YeXKX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f8ad9ebccee7f404c92a4335dc8b641b6d7c3f5d.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fModLiCube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6e597f1742903f59f2ea13a208e0cedbe3951261.png\" alt=\"Telegram\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvk.com%252fmodlicube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb89dbaf73bc3869d4d6ff8784558112bfd7b606.png\" alt=\"VK\"></a>ㅤ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdalink.to%252fmodlicube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5550be1b6b8f92a86a6af1804239a5195607e75c.png\" alt=\"DALink\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>更優質裝備（Better Gear）</strong> 是一款資源包，旨在讓您的物品互動更加直觀且有趣。它新增：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>✨ 武器與工具的<strong>3D 模型</strong>。</li>\n<li>🌟 直接在物品上<strong>顯示附魔效果</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>疑難排解／自訂設定：</h2>\n<p>如果您正在使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold My Items</a> 模組，且不喜歡物品在手中佔據太多畫面空間，請依照以下步驟操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>確保您已安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Respackopts</strong></a> 模組。</li>\n<li>前往「資源包」選單…</li>\n<li>點擊 Hold My Items 資源包的設定按鈕，如截圖所示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d026edb7afc4807570715b9918b882c80011e1be.png\" alt=\"資源包設定\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>根據您的需求調整 <strong><code>Z Offset</code></strong> 和 <strong><code>X Offset</code></strong> 數值。建議的參考數值如下：<ul>\n<li><code>Z Offset</code> 約為 <strong>-0.2000</strong></li>\n<li><code>X Offset</code> 約為 <strong>0.1000</strong></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p>若您發現資源包有任何視覺瑕疵，歡迎加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，並在 <strong>#bugs</strong> 頻道回報問題。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>支援開發者</h2>\n<p>若您能支持本資源包的持續開發，我們將不勝感激！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdalink.to%252fmodlicube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a3c17bd9eeb7a52a1b4a80982af39ae5f7a95e00.png\" alt=\"DALink 捐贈\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>效果預覽：</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><h4>原版：</h4><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0c36c2677007dd852d5bf551351cb42907ca9e8.png\" alt=\"石斧\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b99010c098f6d99a9a14c76d6907963a4827a94.png\" alt=\"鐵鎬\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d57bb1d6176e0095bca4d22758757765e82c174_0.webp\" alt=\"鑽石劍\"></p></div><h4>搭配模組：Hold My Items：</h4><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86d33e6cc66844363f84fef2edcd0f1749496ba3.png\" alt=\"石斧\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0e5c43455046d9a7c11d6e16a855ca43918e8ed2.png\" alt=\"鐵鎬\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ee3d24e3d49b9d7d0fa12be12b09e153c5ca9675_0.webp\" alt=\"鑽石劍\"></p></div></div>",
